The OpenRocket engine is a separate program. rocketviz starts it as a child
process and communicates with it only through the documented engine protocol
(docs/engine-protocol.md), which is part of rocketviz and licensed Apache-2.0.

Distributions of rocketviz include:

- OpenRocket 24.12 (https://openrocket.info), GPL-3.0-or-later.
  Source: https://github.com/openrocket/openrocket/tree/release-24.12
  Modified: the bundled OpenRocket-24.12.jar has the native libraries of its
  desktop user interface removed (JOGL, JNA, FlatLaf; *.dylib, *.jnilib, *.so,
  *.dll). Nothing else is changed. See engines/openrocket/build.gradle.kts.
- The rocketviz OpenRocket engine bridge (engines/openrocket/), GPL-3.0-or-later.
  Source: https://github.com/benabernathy/rocketviz/tree/main/engines/openrocket
- A Java runtime built with jlink from Eclipse Temurin 21 (OpenJDK), GPL-2.0
  with the Classpath Exception. Its license notices are in the runtime's
  legal/ folder. Source: https://adoptium.net
